-- PR 2c live-test: fire a drum pattern through the gateKit GateDrumKit
-- binding installed by the walker from Studio.purs.  Each token maps
-- to a cv-router gate channel + duration:
--   bd → gate 0 → ES-9 jack 1
--   sn → gate 1 → ES-9 jack 2
--   hh → gate 2 → ES-9 jack 3
--   cp → gate 3 → ES-9 jack 4
-- Slowed so LEDs are easy to follow.
gateKit "bd sn hh cp bd ~ sn cp" # slow 4
